  "project_description": "Drutopia Blog is a base feature for the Drutopia distribution providing a Blog content type and its related configuration for personal or journal-like posts. It is config-only (no PHP): enabling it installs the blog node type, its fields, form/view displays, a Views listing at /blog, a Pathauto pattern, a Search API index, a topics facet, and Metatag/SEO defaults, plus config/actions that grant blog permissions to the Drutopia contributor/editor/manager roles. Development is on GitLab (git.drupalcode.org) and mirrored to drupal.org.",
